# Workflow template params

Every workflow’s template fields must match that workflow. Do not reuse the txt2img template form for a utility that has no prompt or sampler.

## Source of truth

In `app/workflows/**/*.json`:

- **`apply`** — template checkboxes and `default_apply()`. New templates copy this list (`create_template`).
- **`extras`** (plus nodes inferred in `_workflow_params`) — Generate `workflowParams` and `templateApplyFields()`.

```text
❌  extras: ["upscale"] but template UI still shows Prompt / Hires / ADetailer
✅  apply + extras + templateApplyFields + TemplateParamsForm + default_apply agree
```

## File utilities

`rembg` and `upscale` get a dedicated editor (per-param ApplyRows + output path), not Generation tabs. Files/Directory drop is live Generate state, not a template field. Do not wrap the whole params blob in one apply checkbox.

## New workflow

Unfinished until all four match: JSON `apply`, `extras`, template UI branch, `default_apply`.
